REPORT zdemo MESSAGE-ID zz.
PARAMETERS p_carr TYPE s_carr_id OBLIGATORY.
INITIALIZATION.
  p_carr = 'LH'.
AT SELECTION-SCREEN.
  IF p_carr IS INITIAL.
    MESSAGE e001.
  ENDIF.
START-OF-SELECTION.
  PERFORM load_data.
  WRITE: / 'Done'.
  GET TIME.
GET pernr LATE.
  WRITE pernr-pernr.
FORM load_data.
  DATA lt_flights TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF sflight WITH EMPTY KEY.
ENDFORM.
